        "intro1": "I'm a 3D generalist based in Germany, currently on the Master's course in <0>Virtual Design</0> at Hochschule Kaiserslautern, where I did my Bachelor's too.",
        "intro2": "Most of the work below comes from <0>relticc GmbH</0>, where I spent a bit under two years as a 3D generalist alongside the degree. Before that I was a research assistant at the university, working on VR, motion capture, and photogrammetry.",
